<% sites -> %>
## Most popular

<%= for site <- sites do %>
- [<%= line(site_name(site)) %>](<%= site_path(site) %>) — <%= tool_count_label(tool_count(site), "Agent Tool", "Agent Tools") %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

